# House, tropical: a stilt house of bamboo under a thatched gable roof, its gable to the front.
# A thatched porch on bamboo posts shades the door; flower boxes and pink shutters as on Variant 1.
# The lid (roof and the two front walls) lifts off; the room stands in the interior box.
